    "pageid": 127859,
    "revid": 834002,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Jukebox.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Jukebox.png/64px-Jukebox.png?19bed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Jukebox.png/128px-Jukebox.png?19bed 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>Century Raffle Exclusive</b><br />\n<b>Wither Scroll in a Bottle</b> is only obtainable during <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">century celebrations</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Wither Scroll in a Bottle</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Wither Scroll in a Bottle.png\"><img alt=\"Wither Scroll in a Bottle.png\" src=\"/images/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle.png?920a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"legendary\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;6Wither Scroll in a Bottle\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Consumable//&amp;7Open the lid and pull out the &amp;5Wither/&amp;5Scroll &amp;7stored within. Can be any of/&amp;7the following:/&amp;7▪ &amp;5Implosion/&amp;7▪ &amp;5Shadow Warp/&amp;7▪ &amp;5Wither Shield//&amp;8&amp;oFancy-looking bottles aren&#39;t the/&amp;8&amp;obest place to store magical scrolls/&amp;8&amp;oof unthinkable power, as they might/&amp;8&amp;ojust get swept up and thrown into/&amp;8&amp;othe prize pool of a raffle.//&amp;eRight-click to consume!//&amp;8&amp;l* &amp;8Soulbound &amp;l*/&amp;6&amp;lLEGENDARY\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Wither Scroll in a Bottle\"><img alt=\"Wither Scroll in a Bottle.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle.png/32px-Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle.png?920a9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle.png/64px-Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle.png?920a9 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nConsumable</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Soulbound</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span> (Solo)</div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>WITHER_SCROLL_IN_A_BOTTLE</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>A <b>Wither Scroll in a Bottle</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span> consumable. It can be obatined from the <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> during Year 500.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Game_Message\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Game Message</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Wither Scroll in a Bottle</b> is a <span class=\"color-red\"><b>MAJOR</b></span> reward from the Year 500 <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Consuming a <b>Wither Scroll in a Bottle</b> plays an animation and rewards the player randomly with one of the following items: \n</p>\n<ul style=\"line-height:inherit;margin-top:0;list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\"><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;\"><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Implosion\" title=\"Implosion\"><img alt=\"Implosion\" src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png/21px-Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png?a349d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png/42px-Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png?a349d 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1x</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Implosion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Implosion\">Implosion</a></li><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;\"><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Shadow_Warp\" title=\"Shadow Warp\"><img alt=\"Shadow Warp\" src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png/21px-Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png?a349d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png/42px-Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png?a349d 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1x</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Shadow_Warp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shadow Warp\">Shadow Warp</a></li><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;\"><span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Wither_Shield\" title=\"Wither Shield\"><img alt=\"Wither Shield\" src=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png/21px-Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png?a349d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png/42px-Enchanted_Book_and_Quill.png?a349d 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">1x</span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Wither_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wither Shield\">Wither Shield</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Game_Message\">Game Message</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Game Message\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Wither_Scroll_in_a_Bottle?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Game Message\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Message\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Consuming\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-d\"><span class=\"format-l\">WOW! </span></span><span class=\"format-e\">You found a </span><span class=\"format-5\">&lt;item&gt; </span><span class=\"format-e\">scroll inside the bottle!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History<